{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/186331-is-this-possible-for-a-demon","id":186331,"title":"Is this possible for a demon ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-02T09:40:22-07:00","id":186331,"title":"Is this possible for a demon ?","content":"I wanted to know is it possible that a demon fell because it some how believed it was human it believed it so deeply that it fell ?<br /> <br /> I wanted to make a character who was put on earth to help guide some one so they were placed there as the persons twin from birth and have been there so they believed they were human. They believe it even if other angels are hunting them they will not use there embeds or exploits on purpose but when they do they just think its something odd and not them or eve to the point of believing anything it has to keep his cover intact. <br /> <br /> Do you think its possible to build a character like that ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T09:54:49-07:00","id":186356,"title":"","content":"Yes. Absolutely yes.<br /> <br /> How they justify themselves in the face of what they do will be a weird thing, but I can see this as either a huge flaw or huge experiment on the God-Machine's part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T10:03:48-07:00","id":186364,"title":"","content":"It's your game, so you can do what you want. I say that as someone whose gaming group always creates slightly special snowflake characters like the one you're describing, so take that as full-throated encouragement to make the game your own and not a sneering reminder about the Golden Rule. :-)<br /> <br /> I think Heirs to Hell will be incredibly useful to someone playing a &quot;born demon&quot; like that. Technically that book deals with the children of demons, but it also spends a lot of time exploring what it's like growing up with access Embeds, which I think is especially relevant to a concept like yours.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T10:09:43-07:00","id":186370,"title":"","content":"One of the nifty things about games that have these sorts of backgrounds, like Demon's God-Machine and Changeling's Strangers, is that special snowflakes actually become more viable for a variety of reasons-in fact you can face whole agencies or freeholds of special snowflakes. Staying on topic, the God-Machine is always experimenting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 07-02-2014, 01:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T13:21:20-07:00","id":186465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/186331-is-this-possible-for-a-demon#post186331\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wanted to know is it possible that a demon fell because it some how believed it was human it believed it so deeply that it fell ?<br /> <br /> I wanted to make a character who was put on earth to help guide some one so they were placed there as the persons twin from birth and have been there so they believed they were human. They believe it even if other angels are hunting them they will not use there embeds or exploits on purpose but when they do they just think its something odd and not them or eve to the point of believing anything it has to keep his cover intact.<br /> <br /> Do you think its possible to build a character like that ?</div> </div> </div> </div> Considering that angels are MADE from humans.... this may actually be possible in truth, and not a delusion. The big G-M is Dr Frankenstein on crack, and the angels are its monsters. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T08:11:15-07:00","id":187073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/186331-is-this-possible-for-a-demon#post186331\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wanted to know is it possible that a demon fell because it some how believed it was human it believed it so deeply that it fell ? I wanted to make a character who was put on earth to help guide some one so they were placed there as the persons twin from birth and have been there so they believed they were human. They believe it even if other angels are hunting them they will not use there embeds or exploits on purpose but when they do they just think its something odd and not them or eve to the point of believing anything it has to keep his cover intact. Do you think its possible to build a character like that ?</div> </div> </div> </div> For the most part, this seems like a great concept that fits right in with D:tD. The one issue I see is that if the angel was created to believe it was human, believing it was human would not cause it to fall, because it's doing exactly what it was made to do. That said , if it's belief in its own humanity somehow caused it to fail the other part of its mission - guiding the other twin, then that works perfectly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}